                                "sense_id": "0dcf46f0-e547-3e2a-a0e4-7ed442a1e1c0",
                                "text": "The most common type of material has been woody fragments which have been cut into granules (rather than defibered) by pulp refiners.\nThe paper is defibered in a stock slusher having a movable defibering or slushing element, while infeeding water."
